<title>USA: Transamerica to sell consumer finance unit.</title>
<headline>Transamerica to sell consumer finance unit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transamerica Corp said Thursday it plans to sell its Los Angeles-based consumer finance operations.</p>
<p>The unit has about $3.6 billion of gross receivables.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co will assist in the transaction, which is expected to be concluded by the end of the second quarter, Transamerica said.</p>
<p>Transamerica also said it will separately sell or liquidate about $550 million of real estate-secured loans, non-real estate-secured loans, and foreclosed properties.</p>
</text>
